            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 40-year-old woman presented with prolonged abdominal complaints, weight loss and iron deficiency anaemia. Coloscopic biopsy revealed a nematode infestation, probably by Strongyloides stercoralis.</AbstractText>
